{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "007X", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-sheafify-epi-mono}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d2cdd54c91172842da7935e351b2e537dfc65808da525fec53dd82898c278104", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c64b0f86fcb98160871a7deb13bd78fa43b08ef4322ef4b89cd3bc3a253bc6b9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a topological space. The sheafification of a surjective\n(resp.<SPACE_0001>injective) morphism of presheaves of sets is surjective\n(resp.<SPACE_0002>injective).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bebf6fadfa098cb1aa3c3f6ce31f0675641ed98ccc16df7a07e0a44fd40f930b", "unit_id": "tag:0H7I:statement"}
